      "why_read": "This text explains Ethereum's significant pivot away from the Poseidon hash function, despite its widespread adoption in zkVMs and zkEVMs. Readers will learn the technical reasons behind this decision, including the trade-offs between CPU-friendly and SNARK-friendly hashes, and its implications for the security of the post-quantum roadmap.",
